Error [E0311]: `.resize()` needs `TerminalSession`, not `TerminalSession?`
  --> tests/ui/terminal_session_optional_resize.jet:5:20
    |
  5 |     child.terminal.resize(TerminalSize.{ cols: 80, rows: 24 })
    |                    ^^^^^^
 Why: a child has a terminal session only when a terminal-backed launch succeeds
 Fix: unwrap the optional handle first, then call `session.resize(size)`
